                <span class="faq-arrow">
                <svg class="arrowDown" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="50px" height="50px" viewBox="0,0,256,256">
